  "main_findings": [
    "White stork predeparture shortwave anomaly remains negative under all three shared-weather block scales; the much broader year-month 95% descriptive percentile range is [-25.1294,-7.4678] W/m2. This is NOT proof cloudiness causes departure or refutation of thermal flight ecology.",
    "Greater white-fronted goose predeparture positive temperature-anomaly difference becomes uncertain under shared year-month resampling: range [-0.3758, 2.2826] Celsius; earlier animal-only interval did not include zero.",
